n leaves he immediately  goes to bed but is distracted with a  painting  he decides to throw it away and goes to  sleep  as usual the dream occurs again with the  exact same scenario and he wakes up just  before he can see his dad while doing  laundry he accidentally takes the wrong  clothes and a woman named maria suddenly  confronts him  harrison startles for a second and  realizes that the woman looks exactly  the same as the one he saw in his dream  she starts the conversation questioning  his intention to move to lafayette  maria invites him to her place later if  he wants to know more about the place  since harrison has no relatives or  friends in the city later that night he  comes to the woman's place and is  shocked when he sees the painting which  he threw earlier displayed in her room  she claims that the painting has been in  her family for generations  after that they have dinner together  where maria tells him that lafayette  collects unusual people so she asks  harrison what his uniqueness is he  reveals his dream to the woman maria  offers him a cigarette but he refuses  politely and goes to the bathroom  afterwards the pair go on a brief  romantic night and the woman keeps  teasing him until they realize that it's  already late at night before he leaves  maria tells harrison that she had a  dream once and saw a black horse in the  middle of the beach outside her beach  house  she states that she woke up and marched  to the window and it turns out that the  black horse really exists she then  invites him to come over the following  night claiming that she could help him  figure out the attic in his dream  the next day harrison hears a woman  singing from the top of the building and  attempts to approach her however the  masked woman sees him and runs away  he then pays a visit to maria's place  again and tells her about the woman on  the roof earlier  maria reveals that her name is charmagna  and she deliberately wears a mask so  that people don't fall in love with her  as she has a beautiful face  not long after maria starts to tease him  and you know the rest  this time in his dream harrison somehow  glances up at the red string on the  attic which he has never spotted  previously  in the morning harrison meets a man who  recognizes maria's smell and concludes  that he just slept with her  he follows him to his room and enters  his room without harrison's permission  the man randomly shares his life problem  to harrison who doesn't seem to care  about it  he states that he works as a turtle's  caretaker whose job is to force them to  breed he even puts a bed in music in  their tank but none of these efforts are  successful  after the man leaves harrison returns to  the sleep doctor and tells him that the  dream changed a little bit after  sleeping with maria the doctor somehow  knows maria and implicitly states that  she is not a good woman which shocks  harrison he mentions that the timing of  the meeting is not as expected and  suggests harrison should start the  hypnosis treatment at the next meeting  while enjoying his time maria suddenly  comes over to harrison's room with a  camera and tells him about a friend  named rory who is impressed with her  performance as an actress and requests  her to send another recording  she asks for harrison's help to record  her after the recording session maria  invites harrison to her party as  promised harrison attends the party and  maria immediately approaches him while  expressing her happiness she introduces  her friends lauren and oliver to  harrison  he is shocked when lauren and oliver  turn out to live in the same body  maria reveals that lauren shares her  body with a 56 year old oliver when  maria leaves to greet other visitors  harrison tries to talk to the woman with  dissociative identity disorder  he also meets a woman that has two heads  within one body he approaches the d.i.d  woman again but now she has turned into  oliver who is harsh and a bit crazy but  harrison enjoys talking to him  oliver claims that he had seen him in a  photograph shown by a mutual  acquaintance which makes harrison  confused as he never came to the city  previously  on the other side a man named rory is  confronted by mysterious guests who turn  out to be the sleep doctor and a guy  whose face is covered the doctor asks  rory to assist him in some stuff but  rory seems terrified telling him that he  is still experiencing nightmares  the doctor then reveals the other guy  who has the exact face as rory  back to harrison this time he manages to  pull down the red string in the dream  and ascends to the attic but he wakes up  just before he sees what's in the attic  he immediately goes to maria's place but  she is away at that moment he then goes  to the laundry only to find the washing  machines are out of order harrison heads  over to the electrical room but finds  nobody there  he returns to the laundry and is  confused when the washing machines are  working afterwards harrison receives a  brief call from maria who is begging for  help  he calls back and is terrified when the  call is answered by rory's office  receptionist but suddenly he hears  maria's distorted voice repeatedly  saying help me  harrison meets the sleep doctor  he informs him that his dream continues  to expand and he saw old-style polaroid  photos in the attic  the doctor seems panicked and asks him  whether he looks at the photographs or  not harry on states that he recognizes  several people but mostly are strangers  the doctor suggests they start the  treatment immediately  before that harrison questions the  doctor's previous statement about the  timing of him meeting maria but he  refuses to answer and plays dumb  after that the treatment begins  the doctor orders harrison to close his  eyes and gives him a riddle but suddenly  the phone rings he cuts off the wire but  the ringing continues  the doctor somehow refuses to answer the  call and harrison hears maria's voice  again  he immediately runs to his room finding  that the room is completely empty  meanwhile two masked men are standing  outside the building harrison returns to  his room in lauren but in oliver state  shows up  he asks her about maria's whereabouts  but she replies harshly  she pulls out a gun and aims it at  harrison while rephrasing the riddle the  sleep doctor said just now  suddenly lauren intervenes and prevents  oliver from finishing the riddle  harrison grabs a hammer and bravely goes  to rory's office  however he is stopped by the guards and  gets tied up  rory claims that she doesn't know maria  he even says that her acting is bad  afterwards harrison is brought to an  abandoned building where the sleep  doctor has been waiting for him  he is taken to a room where the doctor  finally finishes the riddle the doctor  wears a mask and puts harrison to sleep  in his dream harrison gets into the  attic and finds the doctor there he  reveals that the system is almost  perfect but there was a rare glitch  after harrison met maria who turns out  to be harrison's lover in his previous  life and the doctor has to clean  everything up thus he burns all the  photographs  the scene moves to a couple who come to  their friend's house to have dinner  together  however the woman startles when she sees  another woman upstairs  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching
 

